Output website/static/demos/09-detail.gif
Source demos/common.tape

# Detail pane: drill a message, cycle SDP display modes (d), toggle wrap (w).
Hide
Type "sipnab -I tests/pcap-samples/sip-rtp-g711.pcap"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "d"
Sleep 2s
Type "d"
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Type "w"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "w"
Sleep 2s
Sleep 2s
